<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<databaseChangeLog xmlns="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog"
                   xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                   xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog
                   http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog/dbchangelog-4.20.xsd">

    <!-- Modelo de suscripciones, fase 6 (suscripciones-tablas.md #22). Lo devengado, con o sin
         factura todavía. NO tiene tax_amount a propósito -bloqueante corregido: el IVA se calcula
         una sola vez, sobre la base agregada, en subscription_billing_document_taxes (250); si
         alguien añade tax_amount aquí, reabre el bloqueante-. Exenta de @Version (E6_YA_PROTEGIDO):
         el importe nunca muta, el único UPDATE es el sellado PENDING -> INVOICED dentro de la misma
         transacción que crea subscription_billing_documents (ya versionada). Sin enabled.
         chk_subscription_charges_sign es la convención de signos hecha esquema
         (suscripciones-modelo.md §3): CREDIT/DISCOUNT <= 0 cuando NO anulan nada, RECURRING/
         ONE_TIME >= 0, PRORATION libre.
         Cinco FK compuestas, incluida la autorreferencial fk_subscription_charges_voids.
         uq_subscription_charges_company_id es la clave auxiliar solo para esa autorreferencia.
         ix_subscription_charges_pending se crea ANTES de fk_subscription_charges_subscription
         (Apéndice C).

         Issue #402: chk_subscription_charges_sign y chk_subscription_charges_voids chocaban para
         un caso real -mismo género de defecto que "una devolución no cabía en el esquema" de
         suscripciones-modelo.md §3-. chk_subscription_charges_voids exige que todo cargo que anula
         a otro (voids_charge_id IS NOT NULL) sea CREDIT; chk_subscription_charges_sign, en su
         primera redacción, exigía que TODO CREDIT fuera <= 0. Anular un CREDIT que ya era negativo
         -una nota de crédito mal emitida por -50.000- exige un compensador de +50.000 para que
         sumen cero, y las dos reglas no podían cumplirse a la vez: la operación quedaba
         irrepresentable. Se corrige eximiendo del signo fijo solo al CREDIT que anula a otro
         (voids_charge_id IS NOT NULL); un CREDIT directo -el caso normal, que no anula nada- sigue
         obligado a <= 0 sin cambio. No se resolvió haciendo que el CHECK mirara el signo del cargo
         anulado -sería más ajustado, pero un CHECK no puede leer otra fila de la misma tabla
         (https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/create-table-check-constraints.html)-; que la
         anulación efectivamente sume cero con el cargo que anula baja a
         suscripciones-reglas-codigo.md como regla de código, igual que R3 en
         billing_document_applications. Detalle completo en suscripciones-modelo.md §3.4 y
         suscripciones-tablas.md #22. Este changeset todavía no se había aplicado en ningún
         entorno, así que se corrige in situ en vez de con un ALTER aparte. -->
    <changeSet id="251_create_subscription_charges" author="orlando">
        <createTable tableName="subscription_charges">
            <column name="id" type="BIGINT" autoIncrement="true">
                <constraints primaryKey="true" nullable="false"/>
            </column>
            <column name="company_id" type="BIGINT">
                <constraints nullable="false" foreignKeyName="fk_subscription_charges_company"
                             references="companies(id)"/>
            </column>
            <column name="subscription_id" type="BIGINT"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="subscription_item_id" type="BIGINT"/>
            <column name="charge_type" type="VARCHAR(20)"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="description" type="VARCHAR(255)"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="service_period_start" type="DATE"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="service_period_end" type="DATE"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="quantity" type="DECIMAL(12,3)" defaultValueNumeric="1.000">
                <constraints nullable="false"/>
            </column>
            <column name="unit_amount" type="DECIMAL(19,2)"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="subtotal_amount" type="DECIMAL(19,2)"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="tax_rate" type="DECIMAL(5,2)" defaultValueNumeric="0.00">
                <constraints nullable="false"/>
            </column>
            <column name="tax_treatment" type="VARCHAR(20)"><constraints nullable="false"/></column>
            <column name="proration_days" type="INT"/>
            <column name="period_days" type="INT"/>
            <column name="status" type="VARCHAR(20)" defaultValue="PENDING">
                <constraints nullable="false"/>
            </column>
            <column name="amendment_id" type="BIGINT"/>
            <column name="billing_document_id" type="BIGINT"/>
            <column name="voids_charge_id" type="BIGINT"/>
            <column name="created_date" type="DATETIME" defaultValueComputed="CURRENT_TIMESTAMP">
                <constraints nullable="false"/>
            </column>
        </createTable>

        <addUniqueConstraint tableName="subscription_charges" columnNames="company_id, id"
                             constraintName="uq_subscription_charges_company_id"/>

        <sql><![CDATA[
            ALTER TABLE subscription_charges
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_type
                    CHECK (charge_type IN ('RECURRING','PRORATION','ONE_TIME','CREDIT','DISCOUNT')),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_status
                    CHECK (status IN ('PENDING','INVOICED','VOIDED')),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_tax_treatment
                    CHECK (tax_treatment IN ('TAXED','EXEMPT','EXCLUDED')),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_period
                    CHECK (service_period_end >= service_period_start),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_quantity CHECK (quantity > 0),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_unit_amount CHECK (unit_amount >= 0),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_tax_rate
                    CHECK (tax_rate >= 0 AND tax_rate <= 100),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_sign
                    CHECK ((charge_type IN ('CREDIT','DISCOUNT') AND voids_charge_id IS NULL
                            AND subtotal_amount <= 0)
                           OR (charge_type IN ('RECURRING','ONE_TIME') AND subtotal_amount >= 0)
                           OR charge_type = 'PRORATION'
                           OR (charge_type = 'CREDIT' AND voids_charge_id IS NOT NULL)),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_proration
                    CHECK ((proration_days IS NULL AND period_days IS NULL)
                           OR (proration_days IS NOT NULL AND period_days IS NOT NULL
                               AND period_days > 0 AND proration_days >= 0
                               AND proration_days <= period_days)),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_invoiced
                    CHECK (status <> 'INVOICED' OR billing_document_id IS NOT NULL),
                ADD CONSTRAINT chk_subscription_charges_voids
                    CHECK (voids_charge_id IS NULL OR charge_type = 'CREDIT')
        ]]></sql>

        <createIndex tableName="subscription_charges" indexName="ix_subscription_charges_pending">
            <column name="company_id"/>
            <column name="subscription_id"/>
            <column name="status"/>
            <column name="service_period_start"/>
        </createIndex>

        <addForeignKeyConstraint baseTableName="subscription_charges"
                                 baseColumnNames="company_id, subscription_id"
                                 referencedTableName="subscriptions"
                                 referencedColumnNames="company_id, id"
                                 constraintName="fk_subscription_charges_subscription"
                                 onDelete="RESTRICT" onUpdate="RESTRICT"/>
        <addForeignKeyConstraint baseTableName="subscription_charges"
                                 baseColumnNames="company_id, subscription_item_id"
                                 referencedTableName="subscription_items"
                                 referencedColumnNames="company_id, id"
                                 constraintName="fk_subscription_charges_item"
                                 onDelete="RESTRICT" onUpdate="RESTRICT"/>
        <addForeignKeyConstraint baseTableName="subscription_charges"
                                 baseColumnNames="company_id, amendment_id"
                                 referencedTableName="subscription_amendments"
                                 referencedColumnNames="company_id, id"
                                 constraintName="fk_subscription_charges_amendment"
                                 onDelete="RESTRICT" onUpdate="RESTRICT"/>
        <addForeignKeyConstraint baseTableName="subscription_charges"
                                 baseColumnNames="company_id, billing_document_id"
                                 referencedTableName="subscription_billing_documents"
                                 referencedColumnNames="company_id, id"
                                 constraintName="fk_subscription_charges_document"
                                 onDelete="RESTRICT" onUpdate="RESTRICT"/>
        <addForeignKeyConstraint baseTableName="subscription_charges"
                                 baseColumnNames="company_id, voids_charge_id"
                                 referencedTableName="subscription_charges"
                                 referencedColumnNames="company_id, id"
                                 constraintName="fk_subscription_charges_voids"
                                 onDelete="RESTRICT" onUpdate="RESTRICT"/>

        <rollback>
            <dropTable tableName="subscription_charges"/>
        </rollback>
    </changeSet>

</databaseChangeLog>
